  <rules>
    <rule name="Genestealer Cults: Endless assault (Crusade)" id="e40e-ea6e-3bc8-1f56" hidden="false">
      <description>Each time a unit is destroyed in battle, at the end of the battle, that unit is considered destroyed, but it may be kept in the Order of Battle as if a new unit had been added., losing all it&apos;s Experience points, Battle Honours and Battle Scars, and it&apos;s Combat tallies are reset.</description>
    </rule>
  </rules>
