    <profile name="[Action] Conceal" id="b0c5-8e84-c5ee-611b" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If the WARLORD is present in the battlefield, up to 3 FACTION: GENESTEALER CULTS INFANTRY units can begin this action at the beggining of the Movement phase. This action is completed at the end of the Movement phase. When completed, place an ambush marker within 3&quot; of the unit and more than 9&quot; away for enemy units, and place the unit in Ambush in that ambush marker.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
