        <profile name="Raiders" id="3263-021c-6fb8-bec8" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a model in this unit makes a ranged attack that targets an enemy unit within 6&quot; of it, the target is treated as being Exposed for that attack.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Scout" id="7e16-1a9b-162c-cd6a" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of the first battle round, before the first turn begins, if this unit is not set up in ambush, it can make a Normal Move of up to 9&quot; as if it were your Movement phase. This unit must end that move more than 9&quot; away from any enemy models. If both players have units that can do this, the player who is taking the first turn moves their units first.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
