                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Any number of REDUCTUS SABOTEUR models from your army can start to perform this action in your Command phase. This action is completed at the end of your Movement phase. 
If this action is successfully completed, place a Remote explosives marker within 1&quot; of the model that performed this action. If that model is destroyed, remove its Remote explosives marker from the battlefield.</characteristic>
