                <profile name="Hypersensory Abilities" id="2146-fa03-98de-27f2" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Shooting phase, after this model shoots, it can make a Normal Move or Fall Back as if it were your Movement phase, even if it arrived as Reinforcements this turn.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
                <profile name="Heroic Deeds, Heroic Inspiration [Aura]" id="6625-e3b3-c888-9975" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If this model destroys any enemy models in your Shooting phase, until the end of the phase, it is a heroic inspiration. If this model is a heroic inspiration, while a friendly &lt;CULT&gt; CORE unit is within 9&quot; of this model, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, re-roll a hit roll of 1.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
