              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When this unit is set up on the battlefield as Reinforcements as a result of being set up underground, until the end of the turn, each time a charge roll is made for this unit, roll one additional dice and discard one of the dice.</characteristic>
