          <profiles>
            <profile name="A Perfect Ambush" id="1fbe-4bea-c2d8-2d8b" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When this unit is set up on the battlefield either as Reinforcements as a result of being set up underground, or due to Ambush rule, you can use this ability. 
If you do so, select one enemy unit within 12&quot; of this unit. 
Until the end of the turn, each time a model in this unit makes a ranged attack against that enemy unit, that enemy unit is treated as having a crossfire marker and as being Exposed for that attack.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
